From d9dd1b9bebfea6050659c859004c26fc984752d6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: d0773d <dottedquad@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 01:12:10 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 33/48] video: fbdev: start native DSI scanout cold stage

Run the ABI-v3 cold-init request through native DPI, bridge, and
one-frame GDMA initialization after the panel programming boundary.

Initialize and verify deterministic black triple buffers and the
dedicated descriptor page. Use the stock ESP-IDF v6.0.1 video policy,
qualify two strict four-frame windows, then register fbdev while
illumination remains unregistered. Roll every failure back through
verified quiescent containment. The ABI-v2 adopt-live path is unchanged.

Signed-off-by: d0773d <dottedquad@gmail.com>
---
